# Code owners: who must review changes. Every path belongs to the owner.
#
# On its own this file only requests a review. It becomes binding when the owner's `main`
# ruleset turns on "Require review from Code Owners" (docs/owner-settings.md). GitHub then
# blocks a merge until a code owner approves the exact latest commit (stale approvals are
# dismissed). The owner enforces it; no agent or app can change the ruleset.

